   MetaWINDOW can be easily configured to
   operate almost any B/W parallel or serial 
   printer.  Autumn Hill's Baby Driver provides
   immediate additional printer support.

   HardCopy will rotate your on or off screen 
   picture and perform color translations

   MetaWINDOW directly supports these
   HardCopy devices:

         o HP LaserJet
         o Epson MX/FX/RX
         o Any Epson compatible printer
         o IBM Proprinter

   New devices may be easily added by the
   application programmer.
